  "description": "A Bloom filter for .NET 10 and .NET 11. Lock-free lookups, allocation-free string, numeric and span keys, sizing from an expected count and a false-positive target, occupancy estimates, union of compatible filters, immutable snapshots, and a versioned persisted format with JSON and protobuf companion packages.",
  "iconFile": "bitarray_400-min.png",
